#: directory.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"The directory module allows you to create directories of users that can be "
"accessed by callers through modules like the IVR."
msgstr "目錄模組可讓您建立使用者目錄，撥叫者可透過 IVR 等模組存取。"

#: assets/js/directory.js:31
