msgstr "此條目已新增"

#: functions.inc.php:221
msgid ""
"This should auto-populate with the extension's descriptive name. This is "
"what users will search by when asked to enter the first 3 letters of the "
"person's name. For example, if the name is Bartholomew, the caller would "
"enter 227 for BAR. This field should be a name as the search option is based "
"on Name and not the number."
msgstr ""
"此欄位應自動填入分機的描述性名稱。當要求輸入人名前 3 個字母時，使用者會以此名稱搜尋。例如，若名字是 Bartholomew，撥叫者輸入 227 代表 BAR。此欄位應填名稱，因為搜尋選項是以名稱為依據，而非號碼。"

#: functions.inc.php:95
msgid ""
"Tied to a Directory allowing all entries in that directory to be dialed "
"directly, as they appear in the directory"
msgstr "綁定到目錄，允許直接撥打該目錄中的所有條目，如同它們在目錄中顯示的一樣"

